{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-23T15:23:04.879Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"a57641f91cb39b8fa204234a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-23T15:23:04.877Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Fix verified against the real tracker in the package worktree with the pinned pm-github 2026.11.18 extension. The occupant item now carries the structured github identity fields and the link-only marker; the gated dry-run import exits 0 and plans issue 355 as a link action that preserves local content (previously: github_import_owner_conflict exit 2, curated/unowned for content mirroring). The preflight then surfaced the next stacked blocker: the incoming issue-355 body contains a prose Linux temporary-directory example, which the absolute-host-path rule flags under the synthetic recovery-plan id. Per the gate's own remedy, a reviewed false-positive entry was added to the repo gate allowlist keyed by the finding's exact content hash; the same dry-run then exits 0 with zero surviving findings (issue 218 unchanged, issue 355 link, two accumulated new imports planned). Linked test runs in an isolated non-git tracker where the repo-root allowlist cannot resolve, so the linked command validates the allowlist file instead; the full dry-run verification is recorded here and in the PR. Gates: typecheck (server and frontend) pass, lint pass, changelog regenerated and changelog:check pass after fetching tags, identity audit 4/4 pass. Note: the guard-context failure that started this repository's streak on 2026-11-20 is a separate pinned-release gap; this change clears the tracker-data blockers, and the guard fix still needs the next pm-github release."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-23T15:23:04.879Z"}],"before_hash":"3283236dd2bdbecf1a4c54f9f00349de605f1e0ee1ffcac81016b96738960b1d","after_hash":"dcdd65c67316f4894d7a27504ce17bf46716c9dbe67ed9b3b096fab8bf1679ba","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"93d33362ca4316c69378b1ab889dc1ee151634de265c61e1d1f6a94c0b0f05e2"}
